    "title": "Julian Champagnie back in Spurs vs Thunder Game 2 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Dorcas Onasa ,\n3 hours ago Game 1 of the Western Conference Finals between the San Antonio Spurs and the Oklahoma City Thunder was unlike anything the Paycom Center crowd had seen in a long time. Oklahoma City mounted a dramatic rally from 10 points down in the fourth quarter to force overtime, and it looked briefly like the Thunder would complete the comeback. Then Victor Wembanyama stepped back to the logo and launched a 27-foot 3-pointer that silenced the building and forced a second overtime. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
